WEBVTT

00:00:03.201 --> 00:00:07.323
On the Finish tab, the opening message is what the assistant is told

00:00:07.323 --> 00:00:11.221
when it starts a conversation itself, such as an automated text.

00:00:11.674 --> 00:00:15.997
The coach deployment is the model that rewrites the instructions.

00:00:15.997 --> 00:00:18.494
A capable model writes better ones.

00:00:18.946 --> 00:00:23.487
Copy the system message, save the result as a new AI profile, or

00:00:23.487 --> 00:00:26.796
update the profile this session started from.

00:00:27.246 --> 00:00:32.936
The profile opens with the instructions you built, ready for automated messages and calls.

